**Mastering @DataProvider: From Basics to Advanced:**

@DataProvider is TestNG's most powerful feature for data-driven testing. It allows you to run the same test method multiple times with different data sets.

**Basic DataProvider Structure:**

```java
@DataProvider(name = "providerName")
public Object[][] dataProviderMethod() {
    return new Object[][]{
        {data1, data2, ...},  // First test iteration
        {data1, data2, ...},  // Second test iteration
        // ... more rows
    };
}
```

**Example 1: Simple Data Types**

```java
public class SimpleDataProviderTest {

