**8. Performance Monitoring**

```java
public class MonitoredDataProvider {

    @DataProvider(name = "monitoredData")
    public static Iterator<Object[]> getMonitoredData() throws Exception {
        long start = System.currentTimeMillis();

        List<Object[]> data = loadData();

