**9. Data Cleanup**

```java
public class CleanupDataProvider {

    private static List<TestData> loadedData = new ArrayList<>();

    @DataProvider(name = "dataWithCleanup")
    public static Iterator<Object[]> getDataWithCleanup() throws Exception {
        loadedData = loadData();

        List<Object[]> result = new ArrayList<>();
        for (TestData data : loadedData) {
            result.add(new Object[]{data});
        }
        return result.iterator();
    }

    @AfterSuite
    public static void cleanupData() {
        System.out.println("Cleaning up " + loadedData.size() + " test data records");
        // Clean up any resources, temporary files, etc.
