| Use Case | Benefit | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| **Custom Logging** | Enhanced debugging | Log test start/end with timestamps |
| **Screenshots on Failure** | Visual debugging | Capture screenshot when UI test fails |
| **Test Retry** | Handle flaky tests | Automatically retry failed tests |
| **Metrics Collection** | Performance tracking | Record test execution times |
| **Notifications** | Real-time alerts | Send Slack/email on test failures |
| **Test Ordering** | Dynamic test execution | Reorder tests based on criteria |
| **Annotation Modification** | Runtime test configuration | Change test parameters dynamically |
